WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Quality of life shouldn't be
zip code dependent.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.850
Whether you live in town
or out of town,

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.700
you deserve good pay, good schools,

4
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.100
affordable childcare, and healthcare.

5
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.900
I know what hard work and
taking care of family is like.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.720
I'll show up, listen,

7
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.880
and work hard for you every day.

8
00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.100
If I'm elected, my number one priority

9
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.550
will be to work on improving the lives
of working class families.

10
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.300
I'm Don Lippert,

11
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.200
and I'm hoping to earn your vote

12
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.000
for District 45 House
on Tuesday, November 3.
